        <div class="html-container">
          <h2>Club Bundles</h2>
          <p>Member clubs receive these services for free. Affiliate clubs will be offered these services during club registration and then while managing their club in the Club Dashboard.</p>
          <h3>Marketing Services Bundle</h3>
          <p>Available starting Oct. 1, 2026</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Paid digital advertising (included in national campaigns)</li>
            <li>6x4 vinyl co-branded banner</li>
            <li>Downloadable promotional assets and templates</li>
            <li>Enhanced Club Finder listing</li>
            <li>Can apply for <a href="/club-central/club-development-program" style="color: #0068ad;">club grants</a></li>
          </ul>
          <p><strong><br>Pricing Tiers<br></strong>Affiliate clubs will be broken into four tiers based on the club's number of swimmers. Here are the tiers and prices available:</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>0-4</strong> swimmers - $99</li>
            <li><strong>5-24</strong> swimmers - $199</li>
            <li><strong>25-99</strong> swimmers - $299</li>
            <li><strong>100+</strong> swimmers - $499</li>
